  "articleBody": "To convert a garage into finished living space, first define its purpose, then verify zoning and permit requirements, inspect the existing structure, develop a code-aware design, obtain approvals, and coordinate construction. A qualified design-build team can help connect layout decisions with insulation, windows, utilities, drainage, fire separation, and final inspections before work begins.",
